ase in the Scary background, will definitely create a strong feeling for players, in addition the game also has a coop feature to play with friends. Let's play together now.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://deadzonezombie.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "8K Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deadzonezombie.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1834022286978808"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1090756961634676"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1090756961634676"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1668184380, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1090756961634676"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24009207388726013", "version": "1.6"}, "id": "859004781777692", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8235038329902839", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24009207388726013"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binar